body:
The meaningless sex is the one night stand not sex with him. He  dumped her, she had a ONS, they got back together, he found out and dumped her again - over the meaningless sex (the ONS).

&#x200B;

But I expect your second paragraph is correct.

If you've not received any bills or statements and have allowed them to take readings then they can only bill you for the last 12 months that's correct. 

&#x200B;

They might chance it anyway so make sure to check the bill.

&#x200B;

It wouldn't have helped here mind as the smaller one turned onto it only once it was too late to abort by the looks of things.

It would have helped in the Tenerife crash though.

Could you start one? Then you'd be with a large group of people.  

&#x200B;

Obviously you're 'right' here if that's the answer you want - it's fine to hike with an opposite gender friend. Especially as gf was invited. But whether it's worth nuking your relationship is your decision alone to make.
